  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ECC 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A good name",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "better than precious ointment; and the day of death than the day of one's birth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "It is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "better to go to the house of mourning, than to go to the house of feasting: for that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the end of all men; and the living will lay",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to his heart.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sorrow",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "better than laughter: for by the sadness of the countenance the heart is made better.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The heart of the wise",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the house of mourning; but the heart of fools",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the house of mirth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "It is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "better to hear the rebuke of the wise, than for a man to hear the song of fools.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For as the crackling of thorns under a pot, so",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the laughter of the fool: this also",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "vanity.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Surely oppression maketh a wise man mad; and a gift destroyeth the heart.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Better",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the end of a thing than the beginning thereof:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the patient in spirit",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "better than the proud in spirit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be not hasty in thy spirit to be angry: for anger resteth in the bosom of fools.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Say not thou, What is",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "the cause",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that the former days were better than these? for thou dost not enquire wisely concerning this.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Wisdom",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "good with an inheritance: and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "by it there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "profit to them that see the sun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For wisdom",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a defence,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "money",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a defence: but the excellency of knowledge",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is, that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wisdom giveth life to them that have it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Consider the work of God: for who can make",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "straight, which he hath made crooked?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the day of prosperity be joyful, but in the day of adversity consider: God also hath set the one over against the other, to the end that man should find nothing after him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "have I seen in the days of my vanity: there is a just",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "man",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that perisheth in his righteousness, and there is a wicked",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "man",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that prolongeth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his life",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in his wickedness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be not righteous over much; neither make thyself over wise: why shouldest thou destroy thyself?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be not over much wicked, neither be thou foolish: why shouldest thou die before thy time?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "It is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "good that thou shouldest take hold of this; yea, also from this withdraw not thine hand: for he that feareth God shall come forth of them all.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wisdom strengtheneth the wise more than ten mighty",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "men",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "which are in the city.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not a just man upon earth, that doeth good, and sinneth not.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Also take no heed unto all words that are spoken; lest thou hear thy servant curse thee:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For oftentimes also thine own heart knoweth that thou thyself likewise hast cursed others.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ All this have I proved by wisdom: I said, I will be wise; but it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "far from me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That which is far off, and exceeding deep, who can find it out?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I applied mine heart to know, and to search, and to seek out wisdom, and the reason",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "of things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.25"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and to know the wickedness of folly, even of foolishness",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.25"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "madness:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I find more bitter than death the woman, whose heart",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "snares and nets,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "her hands",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bands: whoso pleaseth God shall escape from her; but the sinner shall be taken by her.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, this have I found, saith the preacher,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "counting",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.7.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.7.27"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "one by one, to find out the account:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Which yet my soul seeketh, but I find not: one man among a thousand have I found; but a woman among all those have I not found.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lo, this only have I found, that God hath made man upright; but they have sought out many inventions.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
